  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Woman And Man** (1 review): Reviewer called Woman and Man sick [4]\n- **Fluffy** (1 review): Reviewer found the closing Fluffy incredible [4]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **What Deaner Was Talkin About**: rare: 11 archived performances [8]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2007-10-20.flac** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 33 songs; 154 min; rated 4/5 by 4 [1]. Said about its sound: Room is poor for sound, but recording is big and very clear, surprisingly good for the venue [7]\n- **Ween2007-10-20.dpa4023-s-722**: source not stated; 33 songs; 156 min [2]. Said about its sound: Sounds pretty good but is incomplete; checksum file indicates a missing track 17 on disc 2; Taped front of balcony... actually position given as FOB, slightly right of the soundboard [2][6]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer was in a car accident near Soldier Field, still reached the Aragon in time, and was searched thoroughly [3]\n- Reviewer's driver arrived about an hour later and got a huge bag of beer and whiskey inside [3]\n- Reviewer says the venue was oversold, doors opened at 7:50pm despite an 8pm start, and searches were intense, causing missed songs [4]\n- Reviewer was angry about the Aragon entry process and missed nine songs [5]\n- Uploader says the whole show is present, with disc 2 track 17 only in the flac version [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2007-10-20.flac**: taped by Brent Stober; transferred by Brent Stober; source: Front right corner of SBD Schoeps mk41(DINa) >kc5 > cmc6 >oade m148 > 702 @24/48 [1]. Also: Reviewer's friend Scuba made the recording [7]\n- **Ween2007-10-20.dpa4023-s-722**: taped by shane sheffield; transferred by shane sheffield; source: dpa4023's > 722 @ 24/96 [2]",
